# Installation Procedure

In Terminal
1. git clone https://github.com/Chris-Nathaniel/KaizenML-Grup2.git
2. cd .\KaizenML-Grup2\
3. python -m venv .venv
4. .venv/Scriptts/activate
5. pip install -r requirements.txt
6. get API key from ray using "ray get-auth-token --generate" in terminal
7. python automl-train.py
8. get API Key From Kaggle and paste it to download the dataset



